# Cursor Rules

## General Rules

Do not use emojis
Pay attention to DESIGN.md when making changes
Never use `dark:` css classes. Rely on CSS variables set in tailwind for dark mode
avoid using tailwind colors like green or red, pay attention to globals.css and pick proper color classes based on Tailwind 4 and ShadCDN 2.6 standards
avoid using shadows and borders as much as possible. neat clean UI
prefer JSDoc comments
Be aware the app support RTL and LTR directions. use ms instead of ml in tailwind classes and so on
use pnpm for package management
after changes run `pnpm tsc` to ensure no type errors are found
after changes run `pnpm vitest run` to ensure tests are passing
when editing translations, only update en.json. the rest is automatically translated from it.

Do not launch the dev server. we always have a dev server running during dev.

do not run e2e tests headed

ALWAYS use agentshell to run commands.
ALWAYS pipe the output of dev server command to a temp file in the repo so you can see the output.
NEVER create a .env file.
